   "query": "AI agent"
  },
  {
   "text": "A thing that I think about these days: I wrote a thesis. I wrote it by hand and typed it out. I sweated over it for weeks, poring through the card-catalog, using inter-library loan, living on a diet of coffee and fingernails. I attained my degree. No fucking AI agent did that — I did that.",
